  "name": {
   "zh": "PBR 通道 · DiffusionRenderer",
   "en": "PBR Channels · DiffusionRenderer"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "Cosmos DiffusionRenderer 在一个统一框架里同时解逆向渲染和正向渲染；逆向渲染模型借助视频扩散先验，从实拍视频估计 G-buffer。这张卡交付一套多层 EXR 的 PBR 材质通道：rgba 是基础色，另有 normal、depth（每段各自归一化的相对值）、roughness、metallic。",
   "en": "Cosmos DiffusionRenderer handles inverse and forward rendering in one framework; its inverse rendering model uses a video diffusion prior to estimate G-buffers from real video. This card delivers the PBR material channels as a multi-layer EXR: rgba is the base color, plus normal, depth (relative values normalized per chunk), roughness and metallic."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-12T08:00:00",
  "deliverable": "relight",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
